  "task": {
    "title": "printf 输出整数",
    "description": "已经包含 <stdio.h>，int speed = 120;。哪条语句正确输出 speed 的十进制值？",
    "direction": "电控",
    "difficulty": "入门",
    "tags": [
      "C语言基础",
      "标准输出"
    ],
    "category": "problem",
    "bankVisibility": "public",
    "status": "published",
    "maxScore": 100,
    "required": false,
    "fileIds": [],
    "resourcesUrl": "https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/io/fprintf.html",
    "kind": "document",
    "mechanicalProblem": {
      "type": "single_choice",
      "options": [
        "printf(\"%f\", speed);",
        "printf(\"%d\", speed);",
        "printf(\"%s\", speed);",
        "printf(\"%c\", &speed);"
      ],
      "answers": [
        "1"
      ],
      "explanation": "int 对应 %d。printf 的格式与实参类型必须匹配；不能因为输出内容是数字就任意替换格式。",
